{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Own a collection of soothing tracks that capture the heartwarming stories of animal guests and the unique atmosphere of each stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following items will become usable in your onsen.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Two staff hats shaped like headphones for a medieval musician,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785740/extras/Footage_StaffHats2.gif?t=1750643085\" /></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three items that have a chance to generate stars when guests sit nearby.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785740/extras/Footage_Items.gif?t=1750643085\" /></div></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC includes a total of 61 tracks, organized as follows:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">48 classic letter themes, each reflecting the heartfelt stories of animal guests</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">9 stage background tracks that beautifully represent the mood of each location</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 beta background tracks from the original demo version</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785740?t=1750643085","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785740?t=1750643085","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785740/d135e2e9df34eaca524cedafc21bdf47518f8d67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750643085","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785740/d135e2e9df34eaca524cedafc21bdf47518f8d67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750643085","content_descriptors":{"ids